OL,3,ATwo Mexicans arrested as police uncover
OL,4,Abig meth lab on South African farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Mexicans have been arrested in
OL,7,FSouth Africa after police uncovered a
OL,8,Fmulti-million dollar crystal
OL,9,Fmethamphetamine laboratory in the north
OL,10,Fof the country.
OL,12,FThe lab was raided overnight at a farm
OL,13,Fnear the town of Musina, in the Limpopo
OL,14,Fprovince, near South Africa's border
OL,15,Fwith Zimbabwe. Two Zimbabweans and a
OL,16,FMalawian national were also arrested.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
