OL,3,ATwo Mexicans arrested as police uncover
OL,4,Abig meth lab on South African farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said it followed a two-month
OL,7,Finvestigation into suspicious
OL,8,Factivities at the farm. Drugs and
OL,9,Fequipment worth around 600m rand ($37m;
OL,10,F#27m) were seized as well as an
OL,11,Fundisclosed amount of cash.
OL,13,FA number big meth labs on remote farms
OL,14,Fhave been discovered by South African
OL,15,Fpolice over the last two years - with
OL,16,Fseveral involving Mexican nationals.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
